@apiUrl = http://localhost:8000
@workflowId = substitua_pelo_id_retornado

### Health check
GET {{apiUrl}}/health

### Listar fluxos
GET {{apiUrl}}/api/v1/workflows

### Receber um webhook JSON
POST {{apiUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/{{workflowId}}/events
Content-Type: application/json
X-Idempotency-Key: order-1042
X-Correlation-ID: checkout-1042

{
  "order": { "id": "ord-1042" },
  "customer": { "email": "marina@example.com" },
  "total": 189.90
}

### Consultar eventos com falha
GET {{apiUrl}}/api/v1/events?status=failed
